			"widgets_values":[
				"Restage the same adult ancient-style female painter from the reference image on a narrow wooden painting boat at dawn. Preserve her exact oval facial identity, dark almond-shaped eyes, black high updo, gold-and-jade hair ornaments, small forehead pendant, and blue-gray embroidered layered robe with warm metallic details.\n\nShow her in a three-quarter full-body view, seated sideways beside a low painting table while turning her head back toward the camera. Her right hand steadies a rolled ink scroll and her left hand rests beside a ceramic water dropper. Keep the pose elegant, non-combat, and physically plausible.\n\nSurround the boat with cool morning mist, distant willow silhouettes, still water, one small warm paper lantern, damp wood grain, translucent silk, matte rice paper, pale jade, and subtle reflections. Use bright diffused dawn light with a warm lantern accent, natural perspective, refined historical editorial styling, and photorealistic texture.\n\nDo not add armor, weapons, warrior poses, Japanese samurai elements, extra people, text, or decorative fantasy crowns.",
